# HTTPS in front of the server: Caddy gets and renews a certificate for DOMAIN (in .env) from
# Let's Encrypt, compresses responses, and passes requests on, with each client's address in
# X-Forwarded-For, which the server trusts one hop of (TRUST_PROXY) to rate limit by.
{$DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy server:3000
}
